00:01:02.489 --> 00:01:10.850
The idea of the fundamental idea of modern
monetary theory is that currency need not

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:19.690
be restricted in order to prevent inflation
in absolute terms, and that the creation of

00:01:19.690 --> 00:01:28.240
