depending on what the money is spent on.

00:01:28.240 --> 00:01:32.460
And if you spend the create created money
because we're talking about ones and zeros

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:38.520
at this point, if you spend or allocate the
created money in certain ways, it can be economically

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:43.970
